Advancing the runner from first to second on a ground out feels wrong.
The lead runner should be put out most often.
Grounding out and advancing the runner to third also seems odd.
Usually the runner should hold.

We should run with debug or trace, whichever will show us the probs.
Then look at probs in this situation with a runner on first.
It should be much more likely to have a fielders choice than a ground out.

